     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Sociodemographic marketing is a subcategory of diversity marketing. It intentionally targets certain audiences with attractive advertising and promotions based on shared social and demographic variables. Overlaying these two factors has several worthwhile benefits for marketers."
